    "text": "By Jason Scott Deegan ,\n18 hours ago Trading ski poles for golf clubs is a wise move in Utah every summer. Where do people play? GolfPass releases a Top 10 Public Golf Courses in Utah every March thanks to YOU. We create our annual Golfers' Choice lists by curating the reviews submitted by everyday golfers. We use GolfPass' Ratings Index logic that weights newer reviews and combine it with a course's subcategory averages. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
